### Admin Forum Post Deletion Test

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7144
@adminToken = <YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE>

### Delete a forum post (Admin only)
### Expected response: 204 No Content on success, 404 Not Found if post doesn't exist
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/forum/posts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Pin a forum post (Admin only)
### Expected response: 200 OK with success message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/forum/posts/1/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Lock a forum post (disable replies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/forum/posts/1/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### Unlock a forum post (enable replies)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/forum/posts/1/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
